# Raw ExaDiS trajectory output (config.<step>.data + stress_strain_dens.dat) is
# bulky (~50 MB for the full dataset) and fully regenerable with
#   python3 -m data_ddd.pipeline run
# The processed trajectories in processed/trajectory.npz keep every frame.
**/raw/

# The repository-wide .gitignore drops *.png / *.data / *.dat / *.txt anywhere;
# re-include the dataset artifacts that are part of the deliverable.
!**/vis/*.png
!**/inputs/*.data
